---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base description="Bryo Studio is a small, one-person studio making games, mobile apps and other software.">
  <section class="intro">
    <h1>Small software, grown slowly.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Bryo Studio is one person making games, mobile apps and other software.</p>
    <p>The name comes from bryophytes: the mosses that grow quietly on stones by rivers. That is the idea here too. Small things, made with care, a little nature and a little technology.</p>
  </section>

  <h2>What it makes</h2>
  <ul class="makes">
    <li>Games</li>
    <li>Mobile apps</li>
    <li>General software</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What it has made so far</h2>
  <article class="card">
    <p class="status">Coming soon to Android</p>
    <h3>Pizza Ambulance</h3>
    <p>Ride a bicycle across a hilly town with a tower of pizzas on the back. Get them there hot, and get them there whole.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="/pizza-ambulance/">About the game</a></p>
  </article>

  <article class="card">
    <p class="status">Free and open source</p>
    <h3>Ascribe</h3>
    <p>Documentation written as code and checked like code. Write pages in Markdown, catch a broken link or a stale example before anyone reads it, and build a website from the same files.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="/ascribe/">About Ascribe</a></p>
  </article>

  <h2>Say hello</h2>
  <p>Questions, bug reports or just a kind word: write to <a href="mailto:hello@bryostudio.com">hello@bryostudio.com</a>.</p>
</Base>
